+# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- cbm
+# task #385 (D-113, D-114): codebase-memory's search_graph, the tool name a literal (the same CLI runs
+# index_repository, delete_project and manage_adr; no box reaches them). Measured 2026-09-30 on this tree: rc 0 and a
