+# {"error":"project not found or not indexed",...} on stderr where the project has no index (a fresh HOME, or a clone
+# at another path, whose slug differs), which reads unmapped. The CLI starts a temporary daemon in its own session: it
+# outlived the CLI by 0.44 to 0.48 s, and by 11.6 to 13.4 s when the CLI's process group was killed (a step's timeout),
